vnsnowkey (1.0.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix CapsLock case synchronization across ASCII pass-through and Vietnamese diffs (preventing CHÀo / chÀO).
  * Fix mid-typing Vietnamese loss from browser tab caption false-positives, per-app state leaks, X11 MappingNotify XKB resets, and multi-keyboard modifier disconnects.

