vnsnowkey (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Multi-desktop support (KDE Plasma, GNOME Shell, Hyprland, Sway, X11).
  * Portable QSystemTrayIcon fallback when KF6StatusNotifierItem is unavailable.
  * Game Mode with XFixes XWayland probe and zwp_input_method_v1 bridge.

